The worker/tasks.py half of PR #67 (ADR 0005), for the stage-4 slot that owns tasks.py.

The detection slot (branch claude/s4-detection) could not edit tasks.py. With this patch:
- run_scenario_v2 reads the backend from the exercise's range (db_ops.exercise_range_backend),
  and a real-backend exercise stays running after its timeline (credit comes only from
  Student detection submissions; app/exercise_completion.py closes it when its duration ends).
- ingest_telemetry_batch uses worker/telemetry.py's bulk_ingest (added here with its tests),
  which stamps truenorth.ingested_at. Its OPENSEARCH_URL read replaces tasks.py's, so the
  MOSA vendor_endpoint_outside_adapters count stays at 2 only if both halves land together.
- tasks.py no longer imports worker/detection.py (which can then be deleted).
