tests/worker/test_worker_sql_real_db.py::TestRealBackendExercise::test_timeline_end_leaves_it_running_and_achieves_nothing
(strict, so it fails as XPASS until you do), delete control-plane/worker/worker/detection.py
and tests/worker/test_detection_shim.py, and let dod.sh lower lines_worker_tasks_py.
Verified: tests/worker + tests/api/test_detections.py pass against base2 tasks.py + this patch.

